<title>POLAND: ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP GROUP B RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP GROUP B RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KATOWICE, Poland 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of world ice</p>
<p>hockey championship group B matches on Saturday:</p>
<p> Switzerland	8   Netherlands  3</p>
<p> Britain	    3   Poland	 4</p>
<p> Kazakhstan	 5   Austria	3</p>
<p> Belarus	    3   Denmark	9</p>
</text>
